  "title": "B7：双球空腔叠加",
  "type": "single-choice",
  "question": "两个半径 R、均匀带电 Q 的绝缘球相切，在连心线方向各挖去直径 R 的球形空腔。求两剩余部分间静电力。",
  "options": [
    "A. \\(15kQ^2/(64R^2)\\)",
    "B. \\(49kQ^2/(256R^2)\\)",
    "C. \\(89kQ^2/(576R^2)\\)",
    "D. \\(5kQ^2/(36R^2)\\)"
  ],
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": {
    "title": "解析",
    "sharedThinking": "每个剩余球等效为球心 +Q 与空腔中心 -Q/8 的叠加，计算四对作用力。",
    "sharedFormula": "\\[F=\\frac{kQ^2}{(2R)^2}-2\\frac{kQ(Q/8)}{(3R/2)^2}+\\frac{k(Q/8)^2}{R^2}\\]"
  },
  "analysisPresentation": {
    "collapseEachStep": true,
    "optionMode": "independent-statements"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "stepId": 1,
      "title": "条件提取",
      "content": "每个剩余球等效为球心 +Q 与空腔中心 -Q/8 的叠加，计算四对作用力。"
    },
    {
      "stepId": 2,
      "title": "对应公式",
      "content": "\\[F=\\frac{kQ^2}{(2R)^2}-2\\frac{kQ(Q/8)}{(3R/2)^2}+\\frac{k(Q/8)^2}{R^2}\\]"
    },
    {
      "stepId": 3,
      "title": "推导过程",
      "content": "通分得 \\(F=(144-64+9)kQ^2/(576R^2)=89kQ^2/(576R^2)\\)，方向为斥力。"
    },
    {
      "stepId": 4,
      "title": "结论",
      "content": "答案为 **C**。"
    }
  ],
